00:32:45.930 --> 00:32:49.230
well he use a method
called process tracing.

00:32:49.230 --> 00:32:52.750
So this is the analysis
of diagnostic evidence,

00:32:52.750 --> 00:32:56.160
patterns of evidence
from processes, sequences

00:32:56.160 --> 00:32:59.100
and conjunctures of events
within a single case.

00:32:59.100 --> 00:33:00.910
And process tracing is particularly good

00:33:00.910 --> 00:33:03.803
for looking at the specific
causes of specific outcomes.

00:33:05.400 --> 00:33:09.050
In this case, what we do
